sequenceDiagram
    title GET /api/child-profiles/my-children
    actor Parent as Parent/Child (VR Client)
    participant UI as MyChildrenUI
    participant Endpoint as :ChildProfilesController
    participant Service as :ChildProfileService
    participant DB as :UnitOfWork
    participant Database as :Database

    Parent->>UI: 1.1 Yêu cầu danh sách con của tôi / tài khoản trẻ VR
    activate UI
    UI->>Endpoint: 2.1 GET /api/child-profiles/my-children (truy xuất parentId từ Claims)
    activate Endpoint

    Endpoint->>Service: 3.1 GetChildProfilesByParentIdAsync(parentId)
    activate Service

    Service->>DB: 3.2 ChildProfileRepository.GetAllAsync(c => c.UserId == parentId && !c.IsDeleted)
    activate DB
    DB->>Database: 3.3 Execute SELECT query
    activate Database
    Database-->>DB: 3.4 List of ChildProfiles
    deactivate Database
    deactivate DB

    Service-->>Endpoint: 3.5 List of ChildProfileResponse
    deactivate Service
    Endpoint-->>UI: 3.6 200 OK (List of ChildProfileResponse)
    deactivate Endpoint
    deactivate UI
